    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f0fa4589770b7666e6592f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（过于安静，会让我很难看清环境。\n不过，决定我该跑草地还是沙土的关键，\n一定就在这场比赛当中。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1bae300591e15660a97e06627ad9ebcdc8ab716b85bc3a1127ab4b81f7ccbad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
