    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1114a65bef3bee5d728b8cf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "GⅠ“JBC经典赛”。\n这场经典级与古马级一起参加的比赛，\n被视为是地方沙土王者决定战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1d5f82f441ccabe71e37e643b199956a69f44e695fe2a6cb72d68900bf3741",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791a59a6e030ba12ff11a295",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是十月到十二月举办的GⅠ战线\n上半场。因此对尚未成长完毕的\n经典级赛马娘有些不利……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f975afb9194e8a0a310bee8cb2193e3061f6fee3a05015505788732e0a2a644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f39c9c96aa538ff44d1cd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对两名强敌，她究竟能跑出什么样的成绩？\n也只有实际试过才会知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca951f0570f6990127b8b7714b1083962ec906e417238d18b24d36e5c84ba1b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11110ca7ff1a6ba0f5cef95f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇的实力，和上个世代的北港火山与\n奇锐骏还有一段很大的差距。\n我本来想拖到十二月再让她们对决的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "280c8d348008ce508a38234e0f643a87e12b9c246b83e97121dc2ef71e462e4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821b142a466bd377a1633a69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3132ea0da3501e996cf7251",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个挑战对我来说确实有点太早了。\n赛场位于东北，罗盘也显示将会是个难关。\n不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "851979511776a40241919dc593ba0c2b1d5de006948bd7c05323799d28d37d89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098202.json",
      "json_path": [
