      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f0932c3c4af8eb3c53cb36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摸清楚上一个世代的实力还是很有意义。\n即使乍看之下，我根本不是她们的对手……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67764af7f4e54b0f7557b04517b4d8ef73cc66486efaddb43fc54081c0091924",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
