    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b606be5d7dc0b9f4ec43e456",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她们的气还没有特别高涨。\n比赛的时间是立冬，才刚进入冬天。\n这表示──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dfe7142962e9abf1eae5fd14f0dd4910bbed895e91792b071e4f6095e5e909d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
