      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "火山和锐骏都在为十二月做准备，\n根据我的观察──\n她们目前都还有所保留。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36f8b6aa99d6c572c86df8d84ec13690e066f7edeef4ec7781e93d61754a9f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
